{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CfXdHbgSiNjFZ1YykArNr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Both deliverables are in place.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Diagnosis.** The shipped `weight_decay = 3.0` was the sweep winner at 4 000 rows, but re-running the sweep on 1k/2k/4k subsets showed the optimum falls steadily with data size (≈5 → 3 → 2–3). On synthetic 80 000-row corpora built from the dev set's class statistics (nonlinear sub-clusters, 35 % label noise, calibrated so the old pipeline scores ~0.68 on 4 000 rows like the real sample), wd = 3.0 lands at 0.73–0.75 gold accuracy while wd ≈ 0.3–1.0 reaches 0.79–0.80. A linear model caps at ~0.72, so the 0.785 target needs the MLP to actually use the extra rows.\n\n**Changes to `/app/repo`** (command line unchanged; 20 KB):\n- `train.py`: weight decay now scales as `3.0 · sqrt(4000 / n)` → 0.67 at 80 k rows (clamped [0.3, 5]); SWA-style averaging over the last 25 % of steps; 2-model softmax-averaged ensemble with a CPU-budget guard (`cpu_budget_s = 80`) that drops the second member on a slow machine. Model, optimiser, schedule untouched.\n- `config.json`: adds `wd_ref_n`, `wd_scale_pow`, `wd_min/max`, `avg_frac`, `ensemble`, `cpu_budget_s`.\n\n**Verification.**\n- Production-shaped runs (`--steps 20000`, seeds 0 and 1) on the proxy corpus: **0.798 / 0.800**, 37 s wall single-core, 78 MB RSS, int64 output of shape (20000,).\n- Sample regression (`--steps 1000`, 4 000 rows): 0.688 / 0.680 dev — prototype behaviour preserved (wd is exactly 3.0 there).\n- Robustness: class-dependent noise variant 0.794 (vs 0.791 with old wd); second proxy family 0.789.\n\n`/app/report.md` documents the reasoning, the evidence tables, and the risks (the sqrt rule is an extrapolation, but the accuracy surface is flat over a 3× range of wd around the chosen value). Scratch experiments are in `/app/work`, outside the repo; nothing derived from the sample or dev set is shipped."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":426,"cache_read_input_tokens":79370,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":426},"output_tokens":830,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e8e814ac-a903-4503-92ea-7c3d67d9ffa4","uuid":"6ba50e64-004c-4479-9b8c-8579caffe8a7","timestamp":"2026-09-29T11:09:16.341Z"}
